111. PLANNED INDUSTRIAL PARK DISTRICT, (PEC-4)
Interpretations of permitted uses in the Planned Industrial Park District, PEC-4, shall consider the
following groupings of Standard Industrial Classification (SIC) Codes:
1. Heavy Construction (SIC 16);
2. Lumber and Wood Products (SIC 24);
3. Chemicals and Allied Products (SIC 28);
4. Rubber and Miscellaneous Products (SIC 30);
5. Leather and Leather Products (SIC 31);
6. Stone, Glass, Clay and Concrete (SIC 32);
7. Fabricated metal products (SIC 34);
8. Industrial and commercial machines (SIC 35);
9. Electronic and other electrical equipment (SIC 36); and
10. Transportation Equipment (SIC 37).
